<title>DUBAI: Saudi Arabia beheads man for drug smuggling.</title>
<headline>Saudi Arabia beheads man for drug smuggling.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia on Friday beheaded a Pakistani man for smuggling heroin into the country, the Saudi Interior Ministry said.</p>
<p>A statement carried by the Saudi Press Agency said the man was executed in the capital Riyadh.</p>
<p>It was the third beheading this week and raised to 23 the number of people put to death in the conservative Islamic kingdom this year.</p>
</text>
